Portions of the stage prompts in prompts/ and the review rubric in
prompts/08-review.md are adapted from the planning, analysis, coding and
evaluation prompts of that project.

Changes made in this derivative work:
  - The Python/OpenAI orchestration layer was removed entirely. Stages are
    plain Markdown instructions executed by a coding agent.
  - Stages were re-scoped for agents that can read, write and execute files:
    ingestion, environment setup, smoke runs, debugging, packaging and a
    fidelity review pass were added.
  - Prompts were rewritten to produce durable on-disk artifacts and a
    resumable state file instead of in-memory message trajectories.
  - Provenance annotations, tensor shape contracts and reproduction target
    tables are additions not present in the original prompts.
